        "item": null,
        "confirmedThisTime": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "allowed": false,
        "reason": "unknown-type:teleport"
      },
      "note": "词表外的 type 一律拒，不「先收下、能做什么做什么」"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-type-case-sensitive",
      "given": {
        "grant": {
          "maxLevel": "L3",
          "items": [
            "setting:battery_saver",
            "app:com.example.demo/notify"
          ]
        },
        "type": "Notice",
        "item": null,
        "confirmedThisTime": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "allowed": false,
        "reason": "unknown-type:Notice"
      },
      "note": "type 不做大小写归一化：归一化是凭证那一层的事，词表在这里必须严格"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-no-grant-notice",
      "given": {
        "grant": null,
        "type": "notice",
        "item": null,
        "confirmedThisTime": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "allowed": true,
        "reason": null
      },
      "note": "记录里没有授权 ⇒ 按契约缺省档（L1）判，通知仍可发"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-no-grant-action",
      "given": {
        "grant": null,
        "type": "action",
        "item": "app:com.example.demo/notify",
        "confirmedThisTime": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "allowed": false,
        "reason": "level:L2"
      },
      "note": "缺授权时 fail-closed：确认也救不了级别不够"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-unknown-max-level",
      "given": {
        "grant": {
          "maxLevel": "L9",
          "items": []
        },
        "type": "notice",
        "item": null,
        "confirmedThisTime": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "allowed": false,
        "reason": "level:L1"
      },
      "note": "授权写了个契约里不存在的档位 ⇒ 它谁都比不过（连 L1 都赢不了），不是「未知=最大」"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-empty-items",
      "given": {
        "grant": {
          "maxLevel": "L2",
          "items": null
        },
        "type": "action",
        "item": "app:a/b",
        "confirmedThisTime": false
      },
      "expect": {
        "allowed": false,
        "reason": "item:app:a/b"
      },
      "note": "items 不是数组 ⇒ 按空清单算（往窄的那一侧缺省）；而载荷确实带了 item，所以报的是「这条没勾过」不是「没带 item」——两者是不同的话，不能混"
    }
  ]
}
